 {section==='parchi'&&<section className="panel"><div className="panel-heading"><div><h2>OPD handwritten prescription inbox</h2><p>Doctor-uploaded parchi images and scanned PDFs from this clinic. Refreshes every 30 seconds.</p></div><button type="button" className="secondary-button" onClick={()=>void loadHandwrittenParchis()}><RotateCcw size={14}/> Refresh inbox</button></div>{handwrittenParchis.length===0?<div className="notice">No handwritten OPD parchi has been uploaded yet. When reception/doctor uploads a parchi in OPD → Write / edit same parchi, it will appear here.</div>:<div className="table-wrap"><table className="data-table"><thead><tr><th>Visit / Patient</th><th>Department / Doctor</th><th>Uploaded</th><th>Doctor notes</th><th>Action</th></tr></thead><tbody>{handwrittenParchis.map(v=>{const patient=patients.find(p=>p.id===v.patient_id);return <tr key={v.id}><td><b>{patient?.full_name||'Patient'}</b><small style={{display:'block'}}>{patient?.uhid||'—'} · {v.visit_no}</small><small>{v.complaint}</small></td><td>{v.department}<small style={{display:'block'}}>{v.doctor_name}</small></td><td>{new Date(v.issued_at).toLocaleString('en-IN')}</td><td>{v.diagnosis||v.doctor_notes||'See uploaded handwritten parchi'}</td><td><div style={{display:'flex',gap:6,flexWrap:'wrap'}}><button type="button" className="secondary-button" onClick={()=>setSelectedParchi(v)}><Printer size={13}/> View parchi</button><button type="button" className="primary-button" onClick={()=>{setSale(old=>({...old,patient_id:v.patient_id,prescription_id:''}));setSaleLines([{medication_id:'',quantity:'1',unit_price:'0',medicine_search:''}]);setSection('billing');setShowSale(true);setMsg(`Patient ${patient?.full_name||'selected'} selected from OPD handwritten parchi ${v.visit_no}. Check the doctor's handwriting and dispense only after verifying the prescribed medicines.`)}}><Pill size={13}/> Issue medicines</button></div></td></tr>})}</tbody></table></div>}<div className="notice" style={{marginTop:12}}>Important: handwritten prescriptions are shown as source documents only. Pharmacy staff must read and verify each medicine, strength, dose and quantity with the prescriber when unclear, then select catalogue items and confirm stock. Uploading an image does not automatically create a structured prescription or authorize dispensing.</div></section>}
